@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Student
actor Administrator
rectangle "Smart Campus Room Booking System" {
  usecase "View room availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel own booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block room" as BlockRoom
  usecase "Unblock room" as UnblockRoom
  usecase "Review room usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Booking confirmation" as Confirmation
}
Student -- ViewAvailability
Student -- BookRoom
Student -- CancelBooking
Administrator -- BlockRoom
Administrator -- UnblockRoom
Administrator -- ReviewUsage
' why: R4 makes confirmation an outcome of a successful booking, not a separate actor goal.
BookRoom ..> Confirmation : <<include>>
note bottom of Confirmation
  Assumptions:
  - Only the booking owner may cancel a booking.
  - Touching bookings are allowed; intervals are half-open [start, end).
  - Blocking a room prevents new bookings but preserves existing bookings.
end note
@enduml
